*.pyc
/.graphify_*.json
# graphify per-repo wiring that is regenerated by /iso-ai-init on each machine:
# the skill copies drift between graphify versions (and the codex copy ships buggy),
# and .codex/hooks.json bakes in a machine-specific absolute graphify path.
.claude/skills/graphify/
.agents/skills/graphify/
.codex/hooks.json
